@startuml
title Smart Campus - Domain Class Diagram

class Student {
  - studentId: String
  + viewAvailability()
  + bookRoom()
  + cancelBooking()
}

class Room {
  - roomId: String
  - blocked: Boolean
  + block()
  + unblock()
  + isAvailable(startTime, endTime): Boolean
}

class Booking {
  - bookingId: String
  - startTime: DateTime
  - endTime: DateTime
  - status: BookingStatus
  + cancel()
}

Student "1" -- "0..*" Booking : makes >
Room "1" -- "0..*" Booking : reserved for >

note right of Booking
  R1: startTime is in the future and duration is > 0 and <= 2 hours.
  R2: active bookings for the same Room must not overlap.
end note

note right of Room
  R3: a blocked Room cannot accept a new booking.
end note

' Assumptions:
' A1: Touching bookings are allowed; end == next start is not an overlap.
' A2: Blocking a room keeps existing bookings; it only prevents new bookings.
@enduml
